(- Primary Memory: Directly accessible by CPU. RAM \(Random Access Memory - volatile) Tj
T*
(read/write\) and ROM \(Read Only Memory - non-volatile firmware/BIOS/UEFI\).) Tj
T*
(- Cache Memory: Static RAM \(SRAM\) operating near CPU core frequency to bridge the) Tj
T*
(processor-memory speed gap \(L1 Cache: fastest, private to core; L2 Cache; L3 Cache:) Tj
T*
(large, shared across cores\).) Tj
T*
(- Secondary Memory: Magnetic hard disk drives \(HDD\), Solid State Drives \(NVMe/SATA SSD\),) Tj
T*
(optical discs; non-volatile persistent mass storage.) Tj
T*
(* 4. Output Unit: Translates processed binary data back into human-perceptible form) Tj
T*
(\(Displays, printers, audio synthesizers, motor actuators\).) Tj
T*
